WEBVTT

00:00:01.059 --> 00:00:05.929
Yume kara samete mo
Even if I wake from my dreams

00:00:06.969 --> 00:00:12.309
Kono te wo nobasu yo
I'll reach my hand out to you

00:00:23.949 --> 00:00:29.219
Onaji tsuyosa de yobi au
If our hearts can reach each other

00:00:29.959 --> 00:00:34.659
Kokoro ni nareru no naraba
with the same strength

00:00:35.899 --> 00:00:41.169
Nanninbun no kizu demo
Then I would be able to bare

00:00:41.699 --> 00:00:46.839
Boku wa uketome rareru yo
The pain of many hearts

00:00:47.239 --> 00:00:50.769
Mousukoshi datte kiga surun da
I can feel that it will arrive soon

00:00:50.849 --> 00:00:55.939
Kono kabe ga kuzureru
When these walls will be torn down

00:00:56.589 --> 00:01:01.079
Reimei
The dawn

00:01:02.659 --> 00:01:08.619
Yume kara samete mo
mada minai yume no houmade
Even if we wake from our dreams
We'll have to keep running

00:01:08.699 --> 00:01:14.599
Bokura wa hitori de
hashiri tsuzukeru shika nain da
Towards our unrevealed dreams

00:01:14.669 --> 00:01:21.239
Korogari mayotte tsukuri dasu
boku no inryoku ga
The gravity by my painful journey
will draw me

00:01:21.509 --> 00:01:27.379
Itsuka kimi e
To you one day

00:03:19.499 --> 00:03:20.549
Haseo!

00:03:22.699 --> 00:03:25.859
How can you possibly match Tri-Edge...

00:03:25.939 --> 00:03:28.369
...if you can't even fend off
a Harvest's attack?

00:03:33.509 --> 00:03:35.309
I'll get stronger.

00:03:36.049 --> 00:03:38.209
I'm going to save Shino.

00:03:47.589 --> 00:03:49.849
So you don't feel like moving?

00:03:49.959 --> 00:03:52.019
There's no need for that.

00:03:52.099 --> 00:03:52.959
Huh?

00:03:53.029 --> 00:03:54.219
Why?

00:03:54.399 --> 00:03:57.889
Because I have nothing
to say to you.

00:04:00.639 --> 00:04:02.599
No matter how many
times you ask...

00:04:02.669 --> 00:04:06.039
...I won't tell you anything
relating to that girl.

00:04:07.379 --> 00:04:11.209
How long have you been
sitting there like that?

00:04:14.749 --> 00:04:17.019
One day, the girl...

00:04:17.189 --> 00:04:18.239
Huh?

00:04:25.859 --> 00:04:31.099
She approached you, intrigued after
watching you sit still for so long.

00:04:31.469 --> 00:04:33.699
Perhaps she thought you were
a stuffed animal...

00:04:33.769 --> 00:04:39.469
...given your appearance
and the fact that you just sat there.

00:04:40.579 --> 00:04:43.909
She talked to you
while waiting for someone.

00:04:43.979 --> 00:04:47.279
She looked as if she was
enjoying this world.

00:04:48.019 --> 00:04:49.539
Isn't that right?

00:04:50.019 --> 00:04:51.509
Well...

00:04:51.649 --> 00:04:56.179
Who gave you the right to pry into
other people's memories?

00:04:58.589 --> 00:05:02.829
You came to know
Ovan through her.

00:05:03.099 --> 00:05:05.329
But is that all there is to it?

00:05:05.429 --> 00:05:07.729
If you've already checked me out...

00:05:07.799 --> 00:05:10.669
...there's no need for me to tell you.

00:05:11.069 --> 00:05:14.599
I want to know exactly
what your relationship to Ovan is.

00:05:14.709 --> 00:05:18.909
There's nothing more than
what you just said.

00:05:18.979 --> 00:05:19.809
Oh?

00:05:19.879 --> 00:05:22.509
I'm sorry you wasted your time.

00:05:26.819 --> 00:05:27.759
Where are you going?

00:05:27.819 --> 00:05:29.719
It's dinner time.

00:05:31.489 --> 00:05:32.929
Master Yata?

00:05:34.399 --> 00:05:36.019
It's not a problem.

00:05:40.039 --> 00:05:41.699
So, this is the last one.

00:05:52.349 --> 00:05:55.149
I hope Haseo is doing his best.

00:05:55.219 --> 00:05:58.519
I don't know how you're supposed
to do your best in a game.

00:05:58.589 --> 00:06:00.179
I guess you're right.

00:06:01.659 --> 00:06:07.319
I thought Haseo hated stuff
like official events.

00:06:07.599 --> 00:06:08.719
What about you?

00:06:08.829 --> 00:06:09.699
Me?

00:06:09.769 --> 00:06:12.499
Yeah. You're not gonna do it?

00:06:12.999 --> 00:06:14.939
It's too hard for me.

00:06:14.999 --> 00:06:16.799
I can't do anything.

00:06:16.869 --> 00:06:20.239
If you think it's impossible,
don't you think it will be?

00:06:22.009 --> 00:06:24.739
Unless you act on your own,
nothing will happen.

00:06:24.849 --> 00:06:27.039
Maybe, but...

00:06:27.179 --> 00:06:29.209
There have been
some acrophobic people...

00:06:29.289 --> 00:06:32.519
...who fall in love with skydiving
after trying it.

00:06:32.589 --> 00:06:34.059
Forget about it.

00:06:34.819 --> 00:06:36.589
Never mind me.

00:06:40.699 --> 00:06:41.819
I've been called.

00:06:41.899 --> 00:06:42.989
Okay.

00:06:43.369 --> 00:06:45.299
If you keep moping around like this...

00:06:45.369 --> 00:06:47.229
...you'll get cobwebs
in your head.

00:07:07.619 --> 00:07:08.649
Damn it!

00:07:20.569 --> 00:07:23.539
It's unnecessary to keep
calling me to this place.

00:07:23.609 --> 00:07:27.409
You're involved with another PC
besides me now...

00:07:27.479 --> 00:07:30.449
...so we have to
move even more cautiously.

00:07:30.779 --> 00:07:33.079
Are you going to get me
to do something dangerous?

00:07:33.149 --> 00:07:35.139
Nothing that breaks the rules.

00:07:35.649 --> 00:07:37.549
So, what next?

00:07:37.649 --> 00:07:40.849
The Black Multi Weapon that
was in the Brigade.

00:07:40.919 --> 00:07:42.449
You remember him?

00:07:42.759 --> 00:07:44.619
Haseo, right?

00:07:44.759 --> 00:07:48.359
I want you to follow him
into the Forest of Pain.

00:07:49.069 --> 00:07:52.159
So, he is your target after all?

00:07:52.799 --> 00:07:55.029
Just follow my instructions.

00:07:56.139 --> 00:07:58.569
Make contact with Haseo, right?

00:07:59.309 --> 00:08:02.469
I'll notify you with further instructions
after you make contact.

00:08:03.309 --> 00:08:06.649
Now I know how a cormorant feels
when he's used for fishing.

00:08:07.649 --> 00:08:10.479
I don't understand your metaphors.

00:08:11.519 --> 00:08:15.119
The Forest of Pain
seems like a terrible place.

00:08:15.189 --> 00:08:15.849
Huh?

00:08:15.929 --> 00:08:20.059
I hear it's full of monsters that
you don't see in the normal areas.

00:08:21.159 --> 00:08:22.859
There's no shop...

00:08:22.929 --> 00:08:25.729
...and the only items
are ones the monsters drop.

00:08:25.799 --> 00:08:29.999
In other words, you don't go there
like it's all fun and games.

00:08:30.569 --> 00:08:33.169
I wonder if he went there
to get stronger.

00:08:33.239 --> 00:08:35.339
What other reason could there be?

00:08:36.049 --> 00:08:37.479
I hope he's okay.

00:08:37.549 --> 00:08:43.109
If he simply went to raise
his PC level, I'm sure he'll be fine.

00:08:45.219 --> 00:08:49.849
But if he wants to fight Tri-Edge,
he won't have what it takes.

00:08:51.989 --> 00:08:55.859
