00:12:53.869 --> 00:12:55.169
Do you know something?

00:12:55.239 --> 00:12:56.029
No.

00:12:56.109 --> 00:12:59.129
Is he really a PC?

00:12:59.439 --> 00:13:03.539
I mean, the PCs that he kills
become Lost Ones, right?

00:13:03.749 --> 00:13:05.649
Are you saying he's an NPC?

00:13:05.709 --> 00:13:06.809
That's impossible.

00:13:06.919 --> 00:13:11.409
If he was a NPC, then CC Corp.
would delete him or do something.

00:13:11.919 --> 00:13:13.749
Then what is he?

00:13:13.819 --> 00:13:14.809
An Al.

00:13:14.889 --> 00:13:15.719
Al?

00:13:15.789 --> 00:13:17.449
Yeah, artificial intelligence.

00:13:17.759 --> 00:13:20.289
That's why CC Corp.
can't do anything.

00:13:20.359 --> 00:13:22.329
They can erase the program.

00:13:23.069 --> 00:13:24.189
Aura.

00:13:25.799 --> 00:13:27.059
Do you know of her?

00:13:27.599 --> 00:13:28.729
Aura?

00:13:33.739 --> 00:13:38.269
There used to be a statue of a girl
here a long time ago.

00:13:38.709 --> 00:13:39.909
A girl?

00:13:40.679 --> 00:13:41.839
Aura.

00:13:42.179 --> 00:13:44.119
That was her name.

00:13:44.689 --> 00:13:47.179
The statue in the cathedral?

00:13:47.619 --> 00:13:49.989
Half right, half wrong.

00:13:50.329 --> 00:13:54.699
Apparently, there was once
an Al called Aura.

00:13:55.429 --> 00:13:56.899
They couldn't erase it?

00:13:57.269 --> 00:13:58.259
Probably not.

00:13:58.329 --> 00:14:01.059
It was written in the forum
in the old revision.

00:14:01.939 --> 00:14:05.699
Is that Al called Aura still here?

00:14:05.909 --> 00:14:07.029
I don't know.

00:14:07.139 --> 00:14:10.199
Since there aren't any rumors about her,
she probably isn't.

00:14:11.879 --> 00:14:15.149
I think Tri-Edge appeared
in place of her.

00:14:15.719 --> 00:14:20.089
Like a father apologizing
for his daughter who ran away.

00:14:21.189 --> 00:14:22.319
In place of?

00:14:22.389 --> 00:14:23.689
What for?

00:14:25.889 --> 00:14:27.019
I wonder.

00:14:28.099 --> 00:14:30.219
I think you'll have
to ask him yourself.

00:15:36.229 --> 00:15:37.529
What are you doing?

00:15:37.899 --> 00:15:39.989
Well, what about yourself?

00:15:40.069 --> 00:15:41.759
Not much.

00:15:45.339 --> 00:15:47.429
I think I'll decline.

00:15:47.679 --> 00:15:48.639
I see.

00:15:49.239 --> 00:15:52.039
Well, if you change your mind
don't hesitate to contact me.

00:15:53.549 --> 00:15:56.179
Oh, I just started a guild.

00:15:56.489 --> 00:15:59.389
And I was asking him
if he wanted to join.

00:16:00.219 --> 00:16:01.379
Nice to meet you.

00:16:02.659 --> 00:16:03.959
I'm Seisaku.

00:16:04.789 --> 00:16:06.189
I'm Tabby!

00:16:07.129 --> 00:16:08.819
So, a guild?

00:16:09.129 --> 00:16:11.959
It's like a beginner's support guild.

00:16:12.299 --> 00:16:16.499
The other day I realized
there's something even I can do.

00:16:16.569 --> 00:16:18.939
A beginner's support guild...

00:16:19.009 --> 00:16:20.739
It's called "Canard".

00:16:20.979 --> 00:16:22.409
Would you like to join?

00:16:24.549 --> 00:16:25.639
Are you listening?

00:16:26.849 --> 00:16:28.339
Uh, no thanks.

00:16:28.679 --> 00:16:29.809
I see.

00:16:29.889 --> 00:16:31.819
Well, I'll be going then.

00:16:34.219 --> 00:16:36.659
Something he can do, huh?

00:16:37.259 --> 00:16:38.319
Huh?

00:16:38.959 --> 00:16:41.329
Is there something I can do?

00:16:51.269 --> 00:16:53.609
What did you come here for?

00:16:53.679 --> 00:16:54.699
Sightseeing.

00:16:54.779 --> 00:16:55.669
Huh?

00:17:09.559 --> 00:17:12.119
You're that...

00:17:15.229 --> 00:17:16.219
Huh?

00:17:29.779 --> 00:17:32.609
You've cleared it once you get
to the deepest part, right?

00:17:32.679 --> 00:17:36.139
I haven't been there yet,
so I don't know.

00:17:36.219 --> 00:17:39.919
Just reaching the deepest part
can't be a "clear flag".

00:17:39.989 --> 00:17:41.479
You stay out of this.

00:17:43.159 --> 00:17:45.179
What do you think, young lady?

00:17:45.289 --> 00:17:46.849
There is no clearing it.

00:17:46.929 --> 00:17:48.729
This is no event.

00:17:51.499 --> 00:17:52.869
There's something in that.

00:17:52.939 --> 00:17:54.129
Which is it?

00:17:54.199 --> 00:17:58.069
You can think that there isn't
or you can think that there is.

00:17:58.539 --> 00:18:01.339
Which is more interesting
as a game?

00:18:01.409 --> 00:18:03.669
That's for each of us to decide.

00:18:06.419 --> 00:18:07.509
It exists.

00:18:08.019 --> 00:18:11.079
You must play this game
with the assumption that it exists.

00:18:12.219 --> 00:18:15.189
That's why we are
the Twilight Brigade.

00:18:17.189 --> 00:18:19.559
Did I say something odd?

00:18:19.929 --> 00:18:20.899
No.

00:18:23.099 --> 00:18:24.729
I'm going now.

00:18:24.899 --> 00:18:25.869
Okay.

00:18:26.539 --> 00:18:30.159
If we can, let's meet again
in the deepest part.

00:18:30.239 --> 00:18:31.259
Sure.

00:18:45.649 --> 00:18:49.059
Why didn't you join Kuhn's guild?

00:18:49.319 --> 00:18:51.689
Are you asking why
I declined to join Canard?

00:18:51.759 --> 00:18:52.779
Yeah.

00:18:53.329 --> 00:18:55.389
Because I don't think it's only
the beginners...

00:18:55.459 --> 00:18:57.859
...who need help in this world.

00:18:57.929 --> 00:18:59.959
Not only the beginners?

00:19:00.269 --> 00:19:03.359
I realize that in a game
where there are lots of PKs...

00:19:03.439 --> 00:19:05.909
...it's difficult for beginners to last.

00:19:06.709 --> 00:19:11.269
But I think it's toughest
for intermediates.

00:19:12.409 --> 00:19:15.649
If you're equipped
with powerful weapons...

00:19:15.719 --> 00:19:17.689
...a PK will target you.

00:19:17.919 --> 00:19:19.149
I see.

00:19:19.219 --> 00:19:22.709
They'll continue to kill until
they've reached their objectives.

00:19:22.889 --> 00:19:24.829
There are PCs like that.

00:19:26.029 --> 00:19:28.459
The ones that really need help...

00:19:28.529 --> 00:19:34.329
...are the intermediate PCs
who aren't really strong enough yet.

00:19:40.679 --> 00:19:43.169
What do you want to do, Tabby?

00:19:43.509 --> 00:19:45.999
I wonder what I should do.

00:19:46.179 --> 00:19:48.669
I don't even know what I can do.

00:19:49.119 --> 00:19:50.609
That's not what I mean.

00:19:51.019 --> 00:19:53.719
What do you, yourself, want to do?

00:19:55.489 --> 00:19:57.549
I want to save Shino.

00:19:57.689 --> 00:20:00.029
I want to be able to help Haseo.

00:20:00.559 --> 00:20:01.619
But...

00:20:14.439 --> 00:20:19.309
Recently I analyzed what happened
at Briona Gwydion.

00:20:19.479 --> 00:20:21.139
Did you figure something out?

00:20:21.219 --> 00:20:24.379
I just came across the data
that couldn't be analyzed.

00:20:24.449 --> 00:20:26.109
Ovan, huh?

00:20:26.189 --> 00:20:27.619
I think so.

00:20:28.419 --> 00:20:29.389
Anything else?

00:20:29.459 --> 00:20:32.549
There's evidence of a battle
with Tri-Edge.

00:20:32.789 --> 00:20:33.759
Oh?

00:20:35.799 --> 00:20:36.759
A Sign?

00:20:37.029 --> 00:20:38.329
When did that happen?

00:20:58.149 --> 00:21:00.049
I'd rather be alone.

00:21:00.319 --> 00:21:03.049
I think you'll get to
the deepest part first.

00:21:03.129 --> 00:21:04.679
Is that your purpose?

00:21:04.759 --> 00:21:08.819
Well, there's only one day left
'til the event is over.

00:21:08.899 --> 00:21:11.869
I came as a tourist,
so I'd like to actually see it.

00:21:13.539 --> 00:21:15.869
Do you know what that's called?

00:21:15.939 --> 00:21:16.929
Huh?

00:21:19.269 --> 00:21:20.869
Being a parasite.

00:22:30.049 --> 00:22:33.639
Ikiru wa dokuhai kiyu no kurushimi wo
Life is a poisoned cup of needless suffering

00:22:33.719 --> 00:22:37.209
Nomihosu sube wo dare ga sazukeyo
That no one can show me how to drain

00:22:37.489 --> 00:22:40.889
Taiyo ni sumu toiu kenja no washi
A wise eagle is said to live in the sun

00:22:40.959 --> 00:22:45.329
Habataki dake ga kodama suru
The flapping of its wings
is all that echoes

00:22:48.759 --> 00:22:52.289
Kono futatsu no me ni yadotta
In each of these eyes

00:22:52.369 --> 00:22:56.059
Yami to Hikari sono docchi de
Dwell darkness and light

00:22:56.139 --> 00:23:03.369
Boku wa ashita wo mitsumeru
beki nano darou
Through which shall I look to tomorrow?

00:23:03.449 --> 00:23:07.109
Kawaki kitta gareki no machi
A dried out and ruined city

00:23:07.179 --> 00:23:10.879
Ten to sen wo tsunagi awase
Draws the lines between the dots

00:23:10.949 --> 00:23:17.879
Imi nado nai koto bakari afurete iku
Causing meaningless events to overflow

00:23:18.059 --> 00:23:21.719
Honou no gotoki kodoku
Soothing the loneliness

00:23:21.799 --> 00:23:24.819
Idaku karada shizumete wa
That flames up within the body

00:23:24.899 --> 00:23:32.429
Ankyo eto shitatatte iku shizuku
Droplets of water fall towards the culvert

00:23:32.669 --> 00:23:36.239
Kakageru dokuhai kono sei wa michitemo
Even if the poisoned cup is upheld
and filled with this life

00:23:36.339 --> 00:23:40.039
Kogareru shino yume wa nagare tsuku
My dream that yearns for death
drifts into it

00:23:40.249 --> 00:23:43.679
Toride ni kuikomu tsume kokou no washi
The eagle remains aloof;
its talons dig into the fort

00:23:43.749 --> 00:23:47.309
Habataki dake ga maiagaru
Only the flapping of its wings resounds

00:23:47.389 --> 00:23:51.119
Ano soukyu ni takkei ni shite kure tamae
Let me be crucified in the blue sky

00:23:51.189 --> 00:23:54.559
Ten to chi ga musubu basho ni
bokuwa tatsu
I'll stand where heaven and earth meet

00:23:56.129 --> 00:23:57.599
Next Episode
